<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error petlis-empty"><image class="empty-icon" src="/assets/icons/brand-empty.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="petlis-empty-text">{{error}}</view><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-outline" bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{form}}" class="card petlis-list-card"><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key" class="line"><text>{{item.name}}</text><switch checked="{{form[item.key]}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindchange="change" color="#0D6E6E"/></view></view><view class="card petlis-list-card"><view>本机错误诊断</view><view class="hint">仅在这台设备保留最近20条错误的类型、页面和代码位置，不记录填写内容或登录凭据，不自动上传。</view><view class="card-actions"><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-outline" bindtap="copyDiagnostics">复制诊断记录</button><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-danger" bindtap="clearDiagnostics">清除诊断记录</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{form}}" class="bottom-actions"><button class="petlis-btn petlis-btn-primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save"><image class="button-icon" src="/assets/icons/brand-settings.png" mode="aspectFit" />保存设置</button></view></view>